17
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:40,130
No wonder the boss has so many supplies and high-end furniture

18
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:42,050
It turns out that they are all synthesized. The most important thing is that

19
00:00:42,050 --> 00:00:43,370
